Hello [~accountid:60f6ff1e411fae007085518b] !

From privacy POV, this data is the personal data of the user, considering the following:

# the data originates from a specific user and is added by them to the platform;
# together with other data we hold, it may allow the identification a the user (i.e. via purchase history, patterns, etc).

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
Please clarify for me what is the issue at hand and why we need to understand the ownership of the data so I can ensure that my advice goes further. 
{panel}

Implications of this data being personal data of the user is that we cannot use it however we like and must delete it if we do not have a legitimate purpose for processing (such as defending against claims). Basically, treat it as the rest of user profile data.

