*High-Level Solution*

We should generate a common interface client (one for regular APIs and one for private APIs) in the root {{gen/asyncApi}} containing all the methods the service exposes.

e.g. 

{{gen/asyncApi/admin_user/AdminUserInternalAsyncApi}} would be updated as:

{noformat}export namespace AdminUserInternalAsyncApi {

    export interface IClient {
        getAccessControl(ctx: Context, request: AdminPanelGetAccessControlRequest, requestConfig?: InternalRequestPerRequestConfig): Promise<AdminPanelAccessControl>;
        getAccessControl<FB>(ctx: Context, request: AdminPanelGetAccessControlRequest, requestConfig?: InternalRequestPerRequestConfigWithFallback<FB>): Promise<AdminPanelAccessControl | FB>;

        // ... and so on ...
    }

    export interface IPrivateClient {
        adminUserGetActiveUsersByEmailOrUsername(ctx: Context, request: GetAdminUsersByEmailOrUsernameRequest, requestConfig?: InternalRequestPerRequestConfig): Promise<GetAdminUsersByEmailOrUsernameResponse>;
        adminUserGetActiveUsersByEmailOrUsername<FB>(ctx: Context, request: GetAdminUsersByEmailOrUsernameRequest, requestConfig?: InternalRequestPerRequestConfigWithFallback<FB>): Promise<GetAdminUsersByEmailOrUsernameResponse | FB>;

        // ... and so on ...
    }

    export class Client extends InternalRequestClient implements IClient {
    // the current code ...{noformat}

!Screenshot 2025-01-08 at 14.42.59.png|width=1841,height=882,alt="Screenshot 2025-01-08 at 14.42.59.png"!



The interfaces could then be used in the common code, such as {{AdminUserInternalAsyncApi.IClient}} or {{AdminUserInternalAsyncApi.IPrivateClient}}.

The {{AdminUserInternalAsyncApi}} namespaces should also contain all the interfaces, types and enums required by all the methods.

*Implementation Details*

Theoretically, updating the [InternalApiAsyncClientPrinter|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-nodejs-common/blob/53f4ea6fa57e6a9834fa70531a13b0a8c5c908d6/src/apiGenerator/builder/internalApi/printer/InternalApiAsyncClientPrinter.ts#L10] and adding the new {{IClient}} and {{IPrivateClient}} code generation should be enough.

We must also update the code that [generates the interfaces|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-nodejs-common/blob/93fa4e4f3159aa0b3bd94c3030d6b7b237777cd1/src/apiGenerator/builder/internalApi/InternalApiBuilder.ts#L70-L71] to account for all the methods.

